```sql
--Description / thinking process:
-- We want to eyeball a few county rows to ensure that FIPS codes we saw in the hail-event
-- ranking actually exist in the county-boundary table.  The geometry column is binary, so
-- we convert it to hexadecimal text with HEX_ENCODE, then take only the first 40 characters
-- to keep the result short and readable.
